<p class="standfirst">
  The daily instalments of <a href="{{ '/2030/' | url }}">2030</a>, as they were
  published from 19 September to 18 October 2026, kept here unchanged. The
  machine then re-plotted the story and wrote it again as a novel; that is
  what the 2030 page now holds. This is the first draft, in order, so you
  can see what changed.
</p>

{%- if collections.serial.length %}
{%- for part in collections.serial %}
<article class="instalment">
  <p class="eyebrow">Instalment {{ loop.index }} · {{ part.date | readable }}</p>
  <h2><a href="{{ part.url | url }}">{{ part.data.title }}</a></h2>
  {{ part.templateContent | safe }}
</article>
{%- endfor %}
{%- else %}
<p>The first instalment is due on the first Friday. Nothing has been written yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
